OL,3,GNEWSAWill prison early releases
OL,4,Aincrease rough sleeping?
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndrew Parker spent years in a
OL,7,Fso-called "revolving door" of jail and
OL,8,Fhomelessness as he struggled with
OL,9,Faddiction and mental health problems.
OL,11,FAfter his last release from Nottingham
OL,12,FPrison, he bedded down on a canal
OL,13,Ftowpath beneath a graffiti-covered
OL,14,Fbridge between a hotel and new
OL,15,Fapartment blocks.
OL,17,F"Not being able to stay dry in the rain
OL,18,Fwas horrible," Andrew said. "I wouldn't
OL,19,Fwish it on my worst enemy."
